Here's a minimal example of a simple game loop:

```
int main() {
    while (true) {
        printf("Hello, world!\n");
        sleep(1);
    }
    return 0;
}
```

This prints "Hello, world!" to the console every second. If you want to add more features, you'd add a `printf()` call, a `while` loop, and maybe a `sleep()` call.
